    <div class="market-page-overlay"><p class="eyebrow"><?= e($country->currencyCode()) ?> opportunities</p><h1><?= e($marketLabel) ?></h1><p>Explore companies and compare current investment terms before deciding what deserves a place in your portfolio.</p></div>
